    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone the Crows is a couch/online fighting game where you take control of medieval history's strangest doodles and battle it out using Earth Magic and Enhanced Movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 PLAYERS in either Local or Online Multiplayer (NO SINGLE PLAYER MODE)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised upgrades system to make each round unique\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and fight as your favourite medieval marginalia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates with new characters and maps during year 1 roadmap\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord for regular updates!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone the Crows is a couch/online fighting game where you take control of medieval history's strangest doodles and battle it out using Earth Magic and Enhanced Movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 PLAYERS in either Local or Online Multiplayer (NO SINGLE PLAYER MODE)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised upgrades system to make each round unique\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and fight as your favourite medieval marginalia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates with new characters and maps during year 1 roadmap\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord for regular updates!</p>",
